==============================================================================
M92b S10 -- hard-coded sensor constants across experiments/.
  ground truth: 34 stacks, EXIF over every frame
  canonical: g(iso) = max(iso, 100.0)/436.8; rn(iso) = 1.2392 if iso >= 400.0 else 4.2
==============================================================================

  NAME COLLISION ACROSS CAPTURE ROOTS -- a bare stack name does
  not identify a stack, and the two resolve to different ISOs:
    119MSDCF: D:\personal\macro = ISO 50,  D:\macro-dark-frames = ISO 400

  scanned 165 file(s) with at least one constant; 254 instance(s).
  excluded 193 instance(s) under experiments/M62-sqrt-n/build-head/ -- M62 vendored a whole copy of
  the repository, so its hits duplicate the originals verbatim.

